WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.400
Posit connects the data science tools your team loves with the Databricks infrastructure

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:12.280
your organization already runs on.

00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:16.840
We're the creators of rstudio and the only partner to win Databricks Developer Tools

00:00:16.840 --> 00:00:19.959
Partner of the Year two years in a row.

00:00:19.959 --> 00:00:25.059
Because we solve the scattered, siloed workflows that drain productivity and stifle great data

00:00:25.059 --> 00:00:26.059
science.

00:00:26.059 --> 00:00:28.280
Here's the problem.

00:00:28.280 --> 00:00:34.520
Data scientists need the freedom to use R, Python, Positron, and other tools they prefer.

00:00:34.520 --> 00:00:39.080
But they also need enterprise-grade governance, security, and scale.

00:00:39.080 --> 00:00:44.439
Without this, people turn to workarounds, development happens outside the data platform,

00:00:44.439 --> 00:00:47.880
and everything slows down.

00:00:47.880 --> 00:00:53.200
With Posit Team, your data scientists develop faster, connected seamlessly to Databricks

00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:54.200
compute.

00:00:54.520 --> 00:00:59.959
They deliver insights, publishing apps, reports, and APIs directly from their workflow, with

00:00:59.959 --> 00:01:05.080
governance at scale, Unity Catalog, access controls, and security flowing through every

00:01:05.080 --> 00:01:06.599
asset.

00:01:06.599 --> 00:01:12.480
From Posit Workbench, open rstudio, Positron, Jupyter, or VS Code, and authenticate once

00:01:12.480 --> 00:01:14.040
with Databricks.

00:01:14.040 --> 00:01:19.519
The session connects to a cluster or SQL warehouse, the same compute the rest of the org is using.

00:01:19.519 --> 00:01:23.279
No need to copy data or manually configure your environment.

00:01:23.400 --> 00:01:25.199
Unity Catalog is right there.

00:01:25.199 --> 00:01:30.720
Browse tables, check lineage, inherit the access controls IT already set up.

00:01:30.720 --> 00:01:37.199
Work in R or Python with Positron's Data Explorer and context-aware AI Assistant, all

00:01:37.199 --> 00:01:38.860
Databricks-compatible.

00:01:38.860 --> 00:01:43.919
With Orbital, models translate into SQL that runs directly on Databricks.

00:01:43.919 --> 00:01:49.480
When work is ready, publish a shiny app or quarterly report to Posit Connect.

00:01:49.480 --> 00:01:55.040
Databricks users can query the data using QueryChat, all without knowing a line of code.

00:01:55.040 --> 00:01:57.680
Same governance, straight to stakeholders.

00:01:57.680 --> 00:02:02.919
With Posit, your team delivers the dashboards, apps, and AI products your org actually uses

00:02:02.919 --> 00:02:07.440
from development to deployment, without the fragmentation bog.

00:02:07.440 --> 00:02:09.360
The proof is in the pudding.

00:02:09.360 --> 00:02:14.880
See Posit and Databricks in action, or book a demo at posit.co slash databricks.

